    "reviewTitle": "Excellent Purchase - Still Looks Great!",
    "reviewDescription": "I bought this tote in September 2024, hoping it would last but expecting it would need to be replaced with months. Nearly two years later, it still looks almost like new. I’ve overloaded it with laptop, lunch, paperwork, books, and more, several days a week, and the only wear I’ve seen are a few loose threads I need to trim. I haven’t been especially careful with it, and it doesn’t even show dirt! You never really know with online purchases whether you’re making a good choice or throwing your money away. This was definitely a good choice!",
